*.bak-*
*.superseded
node_modules/

# Local deployment manifest: which extensions this install enables.
# extensions.example.json is the tracked full set.
extensions.json

# Deployed by install_hermes_one_router.py from the plugin repo's
# webui_extension/<id>/, which is the source of truth for them. The console is a
# 121KB single-file build and DESIGN.md documents it; both are tracked THERE, and a
# second copy here would be the one that drifts. Same reason extensions.json is
# ignored: this directory is a deployment target for these files, not their home.
hermes-one-capability-router/console.html
hermes-one-capability-router/DESIGN.md
hermes-one-fact-explorer/console.html
